title: "QuADMESH: A Quadrangular ADvanced, automatic unstructured MESH generator for 2D shallow-water models"
abstract: >-
  Python port of the MATLAB QuADMESH+ library: a layer-ordered
  triangle-to-quadrilateral mesh generator for hydrodynamic models,
  built on top of chilmesh.
